    "body": "Merged origin/main (#224 wear comp, #147 coolant) in 03d1266. Conflicts resolved keeping both sides:\n- `crates/post/src/post/cnc.rs`: `Record::Comp { side, radius_mm, wear }` (main) plus `Record::Thread(..)` (this PR); the COMP parser's WEAR suffix and the THREAD parse arm both kept.\n- `crates/post/src/post/mod.rs`: `pub mod cnc_thread;` and `mod coolant;` both kept.\n- `assets/posts/AGENTS.md` / `docs/CNC-INTERMEDIATE.md`: main's WEAR-mode COMP rows plus this PR's THREAD / `onThreadCycle` rows.\n- `RECOMMENDED.md` matches origin/main (this PR's entries live in docs/decisions/34-g76-threading.md).\n\nRe-test on the merged tree (own target dir), all green:\n- post: post_engine 31/31, comp 6/6; motion: turning_thread 18/18\n- app: lathe_post 7/7, lathe_post_g76 5/5, turning_thread 8/8, conformance 6/6, golden_cl 23/23, posting 17/17, wear_comp 4/4, control_comp 4/4, coolant 7/7\n- clippy -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-cl --all-targets -D warnings: clean (with origin/fix/main-test-build (#253) cherry-picked locally only to get past main's known missing-`coolant` test build break; that commit was dropped and not pushed)\n",
